{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GexVq15BL8uaebZQHNjbcV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心叙事需要从 \"method paper with empirical validation\" 重构为 \"empirical\n2\t  study with method validation\"。 三个 reframe 策略组合使用：(A) Violation Landscape 升级为论文主体贡献——70B\n3\t  低违规反而是 positive finding （\"scale partially mitigates but task complexity determines\n4\t  violation severity — EE RoV 64-89% regardless of model size\"）；(B) prefix-decidability\n5\t  taxonomy formalize 为 theorem；(C) FT composability 作为 practical selling point（\"decoding-time\n6\t  type checking for neural generation\"）。 worst 档下审稿人平均分 2.75-3.25（Borderline Findings），核心攻击面：70B\n7\t  近乎消除违规使方法动机被 削弱；novelty 仍被视为 incremental；CF 15-21% 在 EE 上被标记为 \"method introduces\n8\t  more problems than it solves\"。需要 rebuttal 期全面回应 + AC meta-review 争取 Findings 录用。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: 70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\n13\t  plan_id: P029\n14\t  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on SciERC 551 docs。已完成，实际结果需在 worst\n15\t    tier 下解读。 实际结果：unconstrained DR=6.5%, constrained DR=0%, CF=3.66%。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    70b_scierc_uncon_DR_pct: 6.5\n20\t    70b_scierc_uncon_RV_pct: 0.6\n21\t    70b_scierc_uncon_ET_pct: 0\n22\t    70b_scierc_uncon_R_F1: 11.22\n23\t    70b_scierc_uncon_E_F1: 35.17\n24\t    70b_scierc_con_DR_pct: 0.0\n25\t    70b_scierc_con_RV_pct: 0.0\n26\t    70b_scierc_con_CF_pct: 3.66\n27\t    70b_scierc_con_R_F1: 11.24\n28\t    70b_scierc_con_E_F1: 35.14\n29\t    DR_reduction_pct: 100.0\n30\t    R_F1_delta_pp: 0.02\n31\t    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.03\n32\t  result_rationale: '70B SciERC 结果对 worst tier 叙事是双刃剑。一方面，unconstrained DR=6.5% 远低于\n33\t    8B 的 15.4% （Qwen）和 13.3%（Llama-8B），证明 scale 确实大幅缓解违规。另一方面，6.5% 仍非零——7 个 relation\n34\t    type 中 constraint tightness 高的（Feature-of τ=0.143, Compare τ=0.194）在 70B 下 仍有残留违规。审稿人会抓住\n35\t    \"6.5%→0% 在 SciERC 是有意义的\"，但随即质问 \"DocRED 呢？\"。 worst tier 下 SciERC 被视为 cherry-pick（小\n36\t    ontology，tight constraints 人为放大违规率）， DocRED 才是 litmus test。CF=3.66% 比 8B（Qwen\n37\t    9.9%）低但仍非零，审稿人认为 \"even at 70B scale, the method still introduces new violation\n38\t    types (CF)\"。 R_F1 delta +0.02pp 在 noise 范围内——无法声明 F1 improvement，只能声明 neutral。\n39\t\n40\t    '\n41\t  tables:\n42\t  - name: 'Table: 70B SciERC Cross-Scale Comparison'\n43\t    columns:\n44\t    - Model\n45\t    - Scale\n46\t    - DR%↓\n47\t    - RV%\n48\t    - ET%\n49\t    - CF%\n50\t    - R-F1\n51\t    - ΔR-F1\n52\t    rows:\n53\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n54\t      - 8B\n55\t      - 15.37→0.93 (↓94%)\n56\t      - 1.39→0\n57\t      - 0.40→0\n58\t      - 0.08→9.90\n59\t      - 8.23→8.36\n60\t      - '+0.13'\n61\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n62\t      - 8B\n63\t      - 13.34→0.08 (↓99%)\n64\t      - 0.55→0\n65\t      - 0→0\n66\t      - 0.49→6.56\n67\t      - 2.68→2.54\n68\t      - '-0.14'\n69\t    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n70\t      - 70B\n71\t      - 6.50→0.00 (↓100%)\n72\t      - 0.60→0\n73\t      - 0→0\n74\t      - 0→3.66\n75\t      - 11.22→11.24\n76\t      - '+0.02'\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - 'Bar chart: DR% by model scale (8B Qwen, 8B Llama, 70B Llama) showing monotonic\n79\t    decrease with scale, constrained overlay showing all near-zero'\n80\t  analysis: 'worst tier 审稿人解读：SciERC unconstrained DR 从 8B 的 13-15% 降至 70B 的 6.5%，\n81\t    自然 scaling 已削减 50-57%。OntoCoDec 将剩余 6.5%→0%（绝对 Δ=6.5pp）， 但审稿人可能认为 \"this remaining\n82\t    6.5% would likely disappear at 405B or with better prompting\"。防线：指出 DR=6.5% 仍然意味着\n83\t    97 个 triples 含有结构性违规， 下游 KG 不可用。但此防线在 DocRED 上会崩溃（见 P030）。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t- name: 70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\n87\t  plan_id: P030\n88\t  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on DocRED 998 docs。 8B baseline: Qwen\n89\t    DR=18.46%, Llama-8B DR=26.07%。 worst tier 预测 70B unconstrained DR 在 0.5-3.0% 之间，constrained\n90\t    0-0.5%。\n91\t\n92\t    '\n93\t  expected_results:\n94\t    70b_docred_uncon_DR_pct: 1.8\n95\t    70b_docred_uncon_RV_pct: 2.3\n96\t    70b_docred_uncon_ET_pct: 0.0\n97\t    70b_docred_uncon_CF_pct: 0.04\n98\t    70b_docred_uncon_parse_fail_rate: 2.1\n99\t    70b_docred_uncon_E_F1: 64.2\n100\t    70b_docred_uncon_E_P: 63.8\n101\t    70b_docred_uncon_E_R: 64.6\n102\t    70b_docred_uncon_R_F1: 10.1\n103\t    70b_docred_uncon_R_P: 8.6\n104\t    70b_docred_uncon_R_R: 12.3\n105\t    70b_docred_uncon_total_triples: 17200\n106\t    70b_docred_con_DR_pct: 0.3\n107\t    70b_docred_con_RV_pct: 0.0\n108\t    70b_docred_con_ET_pct: 0.0\n109\t    70b_docred_con_CF_pct: 3.8\n110\t    70b_docred_con_parse_fail_rate: 2.8\n111\t    70b_docred_con_E_F1: 64.0\n112\t    70b_docred_con_E_P: 63.5\n113\t    70b_docred_con_E_R: 64.5\n114\t    70b_docred_con_R_F1: 9.9\n115\t    70b_docred_con_R_P: 8.4\n116\t    70b_docred_con_R_R: 12.1\n117\t    70b_docred_DR_reduction_pct: 83.3\n118\t    70b_docred_R_F1_delta_pp: -0.2\n119\t    70b_docred_E_F1_delta_pp: -0.2\n120\t    70b_docred_absolute_DR_delta_pp: 1.5\n121\t    70b_docred_DR_eligible_triples_with_violations_uncon: ~265\n122\t    70b_docred_DR_eligible_triples_with_violations_con: ~44\n123\t  result_rationale: '70B DocRED 是 worst tier 的核心打击点。预测 unconstrained DR=1.8%，基于以下推理：\n124\t    (1) 8B→70B SciERC DR 从 13.3%→6.5%（↓51%），但 SciERC 只有 7 types 且 constraint tightness\n125\t    更高（τ̄=0.571），70B 的 distributional prior 仍频繁违反 tight constraints； (2) DocRED 96\n126\t    types，τ̄=0.842（loose），大多数 relation 的 domain/range 覆盖多种 entity type——70B 的更好 type\n127\t    assignment 能力在 loose constraints 下几乎不违规； (3) 对标 FT 场景：Qwen FT DocRED DR=0.76%，Llama\n128\t    FT DocRED DR=0.49%——FT 让 8B 模型 \"学会\" schema，70B 的 in-context learning 能力接近但略弱于\n129\t    FT，预期 DR 在 1-3% 区间； (4) RV=2.3% 远低于 8B 的 16-30%，因为 70B 对 96 个 relation name 的\n130\t    recall 更强—— 但仍有少量 paraphrase/abbreviation（如 P710_participant → \"participant_in\"）；\n131\t    (5) Constrained DR=0.3% 因为 70B 本身违规少，semantic mask 的 fallback 频率极低 （估计 <5 次/doc\n132\t    vs Llama-8B 的 57 次/doc），几乎所有 token 位置 semantic mask 生效； (6) R_F1 delta=-0.2pp\n133\t    因为 70B 的 RV baseline 已很低（2.3%），grammar 层消除 OOV 带来的 FP reduction 微乎其微（对比 Qwen-8B\n134\t    RV=29.66% → grammar 消除产生显著 F1 提升）； (7) CF=3.8% 比 8B 低但仍存在——semantic layer 的 per-relation\n135\t    independent type enforcement 在 70B 上仍产生 cross-relation inconsistency，只是频率更低； (8)\n136\t    Parse fail rate 2.1-2.8% 比 Llama-8B (6.8-9.1%) 低，70B 指令遵循能力更强。\n137\t\n138\t    审稿人攻击线：\"70B unconstrained DR=1.8%，your method brings it to 0.3% — a 1.5pp absolute\n139\t    improvement on a 17000-triple dataset means ~265→44 violating triples。 This is\n140\t    a marginal cleanup, not a methodological contribution。At this scale, better prompting\n141\t    or a 405B model would likely eliminate the remaining 1.8% entirely。\"\n142\t\n143\t    更致命的是百分比 reduction 虽为 83.3%，但审稿人会指出 \"83% reduction of 1.8% is 1.5 percentage points\n144\t    — statistically indistinguishable from noise on individual documents\"。 这与 Qwen-8B\n145\t    DocRED 的 18.46%→10.21% (Δ=8.25pp) 形成鲜明对比。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  tables:\n149\t  - name: 'Table: 70B DocRED Cross-Scale DR Trajectory'\n150\t    columns:\n151\t    - Model\n152\t    - Uncon DR%\n153\t    - Con DR%\n154\t    - Absolute Δ\n155\t    - Relative ↓%\n156\t    - ΔR-F1\n157\t    rows:\n158\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n159\t      - '18.46'\n160\t      - '10.21'\n161\t      - 8.25pp\n162\t      - 44.7%\n163\t      - '+0.50'\n164\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n165\t      - '26.07'\n166\t      - '2.55'\n167\t      - 23.52pp\n168\t      - 90.2%\n169\t      - '+0.29'\n170\t    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n171\t      - '1.8'\n172\t      - '0.3'\n173\t      - 1.5pp\n174\t      - 83.3%\n175\t      - '-0.2'\n176\t  - name: 'Table: 70B DocRED Full Violation Profile'\n177\t    columns:\n178\t    - Condition\n179\t    - ET%\n180\t    - RV%\n181\t    - DR%\n182\t    - CF%\n183\t    - E-F1\n184\t    - R-F1\n185\t    - Parse%\n186\t    rows:\n187\t    - - 70B unconstrained\n188\t      - '0.0'\n189\t      - '2.3'\n190\t      - '1.8'\n191\t      - '0.04'\n192\t      - '64.2'\n193\t      - '10.1'\n194\t      - '97.9'\n195\t    - - 70B constrained\n196\t      - '0.0'\n197\t      - '0.0'\n198\t      - '0.3'\n199\t      - '3.8'\n200\t      - '64.0'\n201\t      - '9.9'\n202\t      - '97.2'\n203\t  figures_description:\n204\t  - 'Line plot: DR% vs model scale (8B Qwen, 8B Llama, 70B Llama) for DocRED, showing\n205\t    exponential decay — unconstrained DR drops from ~22% average at 8B to <2% at 70B,\n206\t    undermining the motivation for decoding-time constraint enforcement'\n207\t  - 'Stacked bar: Absolute violation count (not rate) at 70B — showing ~265 unconstrained\n208\t    → ~44 constrained, visually small numbers on a 17K-triple base'\n209\t  analysis: \"这是 worst tier 的致命攻击面。审稿人会构建如下论证链： (1) \\\"Violations are a scaling phenomenon:\\\n210\t    \\ 8B→70B reduces DR by 86-93% on DocRED without any method intervention\\\"; (2)\\\n211\t    \\ \\\"The residual 1.8% at 70B is within the range achievable by prompt engineering\\\n212\t    \\ (schema-informed prompt on 8B already achieves DR↓32%, better prompting on 70B\\\n213\t    \\ should do more)\\\"; (3) \\\"OntoCoDec's absolute contribution at 70B is 1.5pp —\\\n214\t    \\ smaller than the confidence interval of most IE metrics\\\"; (4) \\\"Meanwhile,\\\n215\t    \\ the method introduces CF violations (0.04%→3.8%), creating a new problem to\\\n216\t    \\ solve a vanishing one\\\"。\\n防御策略（reframe A 为主）： - 不争论 70B 数字本身，承认 \\\"scale partially\\\n217\t    \\ mitigates violations on loose-constraint\\n  ontologies\\\" 作为 positive finding\\n\\\n218\t    - 将论点转向 task complexity：SciERC 70B DR=6.5%（tight constraints 下 scale 不够），\\n  EE\\\n219\t    \\ RoV=64-89%（role constraints 下 scale 完全无效）\\n- 70B DocRED 低 DR 恰好证明 \\\"tightness\\\n220\t    \\ determines violation severity\\\" 的理论 claim——\\n  DocRED τ̄=0.842 是 loose ontology\\\n221\t    \\ 的代表，结论是 \\\"loose ontology + large model = low\\n  violation, but tight ontology\\\n222\t    \\ or complex task structure requires enforcement regardless\\n  of scale\\\"\\n- 但审稿人可能不买账：worst\\\n223\t    \\ tier 下 2/3 审稿人仍标记 novelty incremental\\n\"\n224\t- name: Error analysis / case study (EE + RE)\n225\t  plan_id: P031\n226\t  description: '10-20 representative cases from WikiEvents v3 EE results + DocRED\n227\t    RE residuals。 分析 AC residual root causes, CF systematic patterns, qualitative\n228\t    evidence for paper。\n229\t\n230\t    '\n231\t  expected_results:\n232\t    ee_ac_residual_cases_analyzed: 15\n233\t    ee_ac_root_cause_semantic_confusion_pct: 72\n234\t    ee_ac_root_cause_annotation_ambiguity_pct: 18\n235\t    ee_ac_root_cause_tokenizer_residual_pct: 10\n236\t    ee_cf_pattern_top1: same entity assigned PER in one event and SID in another\n237\t    ee_cf_pattern_top2: GPE vs FAC for location-type arguments across co-located events\n238\t    ee_cf_pattern_top3: ORG vs SID for group entities in Movement vs Conflict events\n239\t    ee_cf_systematic_type_pair_count: 5\n240\t    re_docred_residual_dr_per_relation_top3:\n241\t    - 'P31_instance_of: DR still ~3-5% even at constrained'\n242\t    - 'P17_country: loose constraint but edge-case entity types'\n243\t    - 'P131_located_in: GPE vs LOC boundary confusion'\n244\t    qualitative_insight_novelty: low\n245\t  result_rationale: 'worst tier 下 error analysis 不会产生 surprising findings。AC 残留（Qwen\n246\t    2.1%, Llama 3.8%, Mistral 1.3%）的根因已在 BPE collision diagnostic 中部分解释： Mistral 有\n247\t    2 个 collision group 贡献了大部分 AC，Qwen/Llama 0 collision 但仍有 AC， 说明是模型本身的 semantic\n248\t    confusion（如 SID vs SEN 语义相近，模型难以在 constrained 空间中区分）。分析 15 个 case 后，预期 72% 属于\n249\t    \"similar entity types that the model confuses under constraint pressure\"（如 PER/SID/SEN\n250\t    在 WikiEvents 中语义重叠）， 18% 属于 annotation 本身的 ambiguity（gold label 也可争议），10% 是 tokenizer\n251\t    residual（collision fix 后仍有边缘 case）。 CF 分析会揭示与 RE CF 相同的模式：type system 语义边界模糊导致同一\n252\t    entity 在 不同 event context 中被合理归类为不同 type。但 worst tier 审稿人不接受 \"type ambiguity 解释\"——认为这是\n253\t    method limitation 而非 type system 问题。 qualitative insight 缺乏 novelty：所有发现都是 \"method\n254\t    works as designed, residuals are expected boundary cases\"，不会产生 \"我没想到\" 的 insight。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  tables: []\n258\t  figures_description:\n259\t  - 'Case study figure: 2-3 annotated examples showing AC residual (entity type confusion\n260\t    under constraint), CF pattern (cross-event type drift), and one success case (constraint\n261\t    correctly preventing invalid argument assignment)'\n262\t  analysis: 'error analysis 在 worst tier 下是 necessary but not sufficient。审稿人 comment：\n263\t    \"The error analysis confirms that residual violations are due to model confusion\n264\t    between semantically similar types, which is expected. The CF analysis shows the\n265\t    method systematically introduces a new violation category. Neither finding is\n266\t    surprising or provides actionable insight for improving the method.\" 防御：将 error\n267\t    analysis 定位为 \"empirical validation of the decidability taxonomy\" ——AC residuals\n268\t    是 category (b) constraints 的 boundary cases，CF 是 category (c) non-local constraints\n269\t    的 concrete manifestation。但这在 worst tier 下仅获得 \"adequate but not compelling\" 评价。\n270\t\n271\t    '\n272\t- name: EE FT composability\n273\t  plan_id: P032\n274\t  description: 'Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents Event Extraction。 验证 FT\n275\t    regime 下 constrained decoding 的 composability。 估算 ~30 GPU-hours，仅时间允许时执行。\n276\t\n277\t    '\n278\t  expected_results:\n279\t    ee_ft_uncon_EV_pct: 0.5\n280\t    ee_ft_uncon_RoV_pct: 8.2\n281\t    ee_ft_uncon_AC_pct: 0.4\n282\t    ee_ft_uncon_CF_pct: 0.1\n283\t    ee_ft_uncon_trigger_f1: 62.5\n284\t    ee_ft_uncon_argument_f1: 38.0\n285\t    ee_ft_uncon_entity_f1: 71.3\n286\t    ee_ft_con_EV_pct: 0.0\n287\t    ee_ft_con_RoV_pct: 0.0\n288\t    ee_ft_con_AC_pct: 0.1\n289\t    ee_ft_con_CF_pct: 1.8\n290\t    ee_ft_con_trigger_f1: 62.3\n291\t    ee_ft_con_argument_f1: 37.8\n292\t    ee_ft_con_entity_f1: 71.0\n293\t    RoV_reduction_pct: 100.0\n294\t    AC_reduction_pct: 75.0\n295\t    argument_f1_delta_pp: -0.2\n296\t    ee_ft_total_violations_uncon_pct: 9.2\n297\t    ee_ft_total_violations_con_pct: 1.9\n298\t  result_rationale: \"FT composability 在 RE 上已验证（Qwen DocRED: DR 0.76%→0.01%, R_F1\\\n299\t    \\ -0.30pp； Llama DocRED: DR 0.49%→0.20%, R_F1 +0.51pp）。EE FT 预期模式类似但更复杂：\\n(1)\\\n300\t    \\ FT 大幅降低 EV 和 RoV（模型学会了 event type 和 role vocabulary），预期 EV 0.5%、RoV 8.2%（比 ZS\\\n301\t    \\ 的 24-37% 和 64-89% 大幅下降但不为零——EE 的 56 event types × 80 roles 比 RE 的 96 relation\\\n302\t    \\ types 更复杂，长尾 event types 训练样本不足）； (2) AC 从 ZS 的 0-3.8% 降至 0.4%（FT 改善 entity\\\n303\t    \\ type assignment）； (3) Constrained 消除所有 EV/RoV（grammar+semantic 层直接生效），AC 降至\\\n304\t    \\ 0.1%； (4) CF 从 0.1%→1.8%（semantic layer 引入的系统性副作用，但比 ZS 的 14-21% 低很多—— FT 模型本身更一致，cross-event\\\n305\t    \\ type drift 减少）； (5) F1 基本 neutral（delta <0.5pp），因为 FT 模型 RoV baseline 已低，grammar/semantic\\\n306\t    \\ 消除 OOV 带来的 FP reduction 有限。\\nworst tier 审稿人反应： - \\\"FT regime is the realistic\\\n307\t    \\ deployment scenario. FT already reduces violations\\n  to <10%. The additional\\\n308\t    \\ 7pp reduction from OntoCoDec (9.2%→1.9%) is useful but\\n  incremental — the\\\n309\t    \\ heavy lifting is done by fine-tuning, not your method.\\\"\\n- \\\"F1 delta is negative\\\n310\t    \\ (-0.2pp), so the method doesn't even preserve quality.\\\" - 但 \\\"decoding-time\\\n311\t    \\ type checking\\\" angle 对 industry reviewers 仍有吸引力\\n  （类比 static typing for neural\\\n312\t    \\ generation），这是 reframe C 的核心卖点。\\n\"\n313\t  tables:\n314\t  - name: 'Table: EE FT Composability (WikiEvents, Qwen3-8B)'\n315\t    columns:\n316\t    - Condition\n317\t    - EV%\n318\t    - RoV%\n319\t    - AC%\n320\t    - CF%\n321\t    - Trig-F1\n322\t    - Arg-F1\n323\t    - Ent-F1\n324\t    rows:\n325\t    - - FT unconstrained\n326\t      - '0.5'\n327\t      - '8.2'\n328\t      - '0.4'\n329\t      - '0.1'\n330\t      - '62.5'\n331\t      - '38.0'\n332\t      - '71.3'\n333\t    - - FT constrained\n334\t      - '0.0'\n335\t      - '0.0'\n336\t      - '0.1'\n337\t      - '1.8'\n338\t      - '62.3'\n339\t      - '37.8'\n340\t      - '71.0'\n341\t    - - ZS unconstrained (ref)\n342\t      - '24.0'\n343\t      - '74.9'\n344\t      - '0.3'\n345\t      - '0.0'\n346\t      - '11.8'\n347\t      - '0.1'\n348\t      - '0.0'\n349\t    - - ZS constrained (ref)\n350\t      - '0.0'\n351\t      - '0.0'\n352\t      - '2.1'\n353\t      - '21.1'\n354\t      - '13.4'\n355\t      - '1.7'\n356\t      - '14.1'\n357\t  figures_description: []\n358\t  analysis: 'worst tier 下 EE FT composability 是 reframe C 的关键支撑。即使审稿人质疑 ZS 场景的 practical\n359\t    relevance，FT 结果展示 \"even well-trained models benefit from decoding-time type checking\"。但攻击面是\n360\t    F1 delta 为负——虽然微小（-0.2pp），在 worst tier 下会被 放大为 \"method degrades the model it''s\n361\t    supposed to help\"。 如果时间不够（May 25 前），此实验可能无法完成。没有此数据，论文缺少 EE+FT 交叉 验证，reframe C\n362\t    在 EE 维度的支撑变弱。建议如果必须砍实验，保留 RE FT 数据即可， EE FT 降级为 future work，但这会被审稿人标记为 \"incomplete\n363\t    evaluation\"。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t- name: Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\n367\t  plan_id: P033\n368\t  description: 'WikiEvents grammar_only ablation on Qwen3-8B 和 Llama-3.1-8B， 补全 Mistral\n369\t    grammar_only v3 已有的消融证据。\n370\t\n371\t    '\n372\t  expected_results:\n373\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0.0\n374\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 71.5\n375\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_AC_pct: 8.4\n376\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.2\n377\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_trigger_f1: 12.8\n378\t    qwen_ee_grammar_only_entity_f1: 0.5\n379\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0.0\n380\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 77.2\n381\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_AC_pct: 11.6\n382\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.1\n383\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_trigger_f1: 6.9\n384\t    llama_ee_grammar_only_entity_f1: 1.2\n385\t    grammar_only_RoV_range: 64-77%\n386\t    grammar_only_AC_surfacing_range: 8-14%\n387\t    semantic_layer_necessity_confirmed: true\n388\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral grammar_only v3 已显示：EV→0%, RoV=64%, AC=13.8%, CF=1.1%。\n389\t    Qwen 和 Llama grammar_only 预期模式一致但具体数值因模型特性不同：\n390\t\n391\t    (1) EV→0%（所有模型）：grammar CFG 限制 event type vocabulary 是确定性消除； (2) RoV 71.5%（Qwen）和\n392\t    77.2%（Llama）：grammar CFG 无法 enforce context-dependent role constraints（需要知道当前\n393\t    event type 才能确定 allowed roles），这是 structural limitation 不是 implementation bug。Llama\n394\t    RoV 更高是因为 Llama unconstrained baseline RoV=88.8% > Qwen 74.9%——grammar 消除 EV 后暴露更多\n395\t    latent RoV violations （与 RE 中 grammar 暴露 latent DR 的模式完全对应）； (3) AC 8.4-11.6%：grammar-only\n396\t    下 RoV 仍高 → 很多 role assignment 是 OOV → valid role 的 AC check 基于 grammar 强制匹配的 role（可能不是模型意图的\n397\t    role） → AC 升高。与 Mistral 的 13.8% 一致； (4) CF 极低（0.1-0.2%）：grammar 不引入 cross-event\n398\t    type drift，CF 主要来自 semantic layer 的 per-event independent enforcement。\n399\t\n400\t    worst tier 审稿人反应：\"Grammar CFG cannot handle context-dependent constraints — this\n401\t    is obvious from the CFG formalism itself. Demonstrating it empirically on 3 models\n402\t    adds confirmation but not insight. The real question is whether the semantic layer\n403\t    is novel, and it''s just a lookup table with logit masking.\"\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  tables:\n407\t  - name: 'Table: Grammar-only Ablation Cross-Model (WikiEvents EE)'\n408\t    columns:\n409\t    - Model\n410\t    - EV%\n411\t    - RoV%\n412\t    - AC%\n413\t    - CF%\n414\t    - Ent-F1\n415\t    rows:\n416\t    - - Qwen3-8B grammar_only\n417\t      - '0'\n418\t      - '71.5'\n419\t      - '8.4'\n420\t      - '0.2'\n421\t      - '0.5'\n422\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B grammar_only\n423\t      - '0'\n424\t      - '77.2'\n425\t      - '11.6'\n426\t      - '0.1'\n427\t      - '1.2'\n428\t    - - Mistral-7B grammar_only (actual)\n429\t      - '0'\n430\t      - '64.0'\n431\t      - '13.8'\n432\t      - '1.1'\n433\t      - '11.9'\n434\t    - - Qwen3-8B full_s1 (ref)\n435\t      - '0'\n436\t      - '0'\n437\t      - '2.1'\n438\t      - '21.1'\n439\t      - '14.1'\n440\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B full_s1 (ref)\n441\t      - '0'\n442\t      - '0'\n443\t      - '3.8'\n444\t      - '17.2'\n445\t      - '17.6'\n446\t    - - Mistral-7B full_s1 (ref)\n447\t      - '0'\n448\t      - '0'\n449\t      - '1.3'\n450\t      - '14.9'\n451\t      - '11.7'\n452\t  figures_description:\n453\t  - 'Grouped bar: RoV% under grammar_only vs full_s1 across 3 models, showing semantic\n454\t    layer reduces RoV from 64-77% to 0%'\n455\t  analysis: '消融结果 mechanically confirms semantic layer necessity，但 worst tier 审稿人\n456\t    认为 \"this is a predictable result from the method design, not an empirical finding\"。\n457\t    此实验的价值在于 completeness（审稿人不能攻击 \"only tested grammar_only on one model\"）， 但对 novelty\n458\t    评分无贡献。优先级 Tier 3 合理——如果时间紧可以只报 Mistral（已有）， Qwen/Llama 放 appendix 或省略。\n459\t\n460\t    '\n461\t- name: Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\n462\t  plan_id: P034\n463\t  description: '10000-iteration bootstrap CI for WikiEvents EE F1 changes (constrained\n464\t    vs unconstrained, 3 models)。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  expected_results:\n468\t    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.55\n469\t    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.08\n470\t    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n471\t    - -0.2\n472\t    - 3.3\n473\t    qwen_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 14.09\n474\t    qwen_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n475\t    qwen_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n476\t    - 10.5\n477\t    - 17.8\n478\t    llama_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.76\n479\t    llama_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.12\n480\t    llama_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n481\t    - -0.5\n482\t    - 4.0\n483\t    llama_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 17.63\n484\t    llama_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n485\t    llama_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n486\t    - 13.8\n487\t    - 21.5\n488\t    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.5\n489\t    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.15\n490\t    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n491\t    - -0.6\n492\t    - 3.6\n493\t    mistral_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 11.71\n494\t    mistral_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n495\t    mistral_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n496\t    - 8.2\n497\t    - 15.2\n498\t    trigger_f1_significant_count: 0/3\n499\t    entity_f1_significant_count: 3/3\n500\t    argument_f1_too_low_for_ci: true\n501\t  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI 预测基于以下分析：\n502\t\n503\t    (1) Entity F1 从 0%→11-18% 的改变在所有模型上都 highly significant（p<0.001）。 但审稿人会 dismiss\n504\t    这个结果：\"Entity F1 going from 0% to 14% is not a semantic improvement — it''s format\n505\t    compliance. Without grammar enforcement, the JSON output is so malformed that\n506\t    the parser can''t extract entities at all. This is measuring parser compatibility,\n507\t    not extraction quality.\" 这是准确的——unconstrained 的 entity_f1=0% 是因为 parser 无法识别 non-schema\n508\t    entity types，不是因为 entity spans 不正确。\n509\t\n510\t    (2) Trigger F1 delta 1.5-1.8pp 在所有模型上都 NOT significant（p=0.08-0.15）。 246 docs\n511\t    样本量下，trigger 级别的 bootstrap variance 较大（每个 doc 平均 只有 ~2-3 trigger mentions），CI\n512\t    跨越零。worst tier 审稿人：\"Trigger F1 improvement is within noise — the method doesn''t\n513\t    improve event detection.\"\n514\t\n515\t    (3) Argument F1 太低（0.3-1.7%）无法做有意义的 CI——bootstrap 在此量级下 方差占比过高，CI 宽度 > point estimate。\n516\t\n517\t    (4) worst tier 关键：所有 \"显著\" 的 F1 improvement 都来自 format compliance 而非 semantic improvement。审稿人\n518\t    framing：\"If your contribution is making JSON parseable, that''s an engineering\n519\t    contribution, not a research contribution.\"\n520\t\n521\t    '\n522\t  tables:\n523\t  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap CI for EE F1 (10000 iterations)'\n524\t    columns:\n525\t    - Model\n526\t    - Metric\n527\t    - Δ (pp)\n528\t    - 95% CI\n529\t    - p-value\n530\t    - Significant?\n531\t    rows:\n532\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n533\t      - Trigger F1\n534\t      - '+1.55'\n535\t      - '[-0.2, +3.3]'\n536\t      - '0.08'\n537\t      - 'No'\n538\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n539\t      - Entity F1\n540\t      - '+14.09'\n541\t      - '[+10.5, +17.8]'\n542\t      - <0.001\n543\t      - Yes*\n544\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n545\t      - Trigger F1\n546\t      - '+1.76'\n547\t      - '[-0.5, +4.0]'\n548\t      - '0.12'\n549\t      - 'No'\n550\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n551\t      - Entity F1\n552\t      - '+17.63'\n553\t      - '[+13.8, +21.5]'\n554\t      - <0.001\n555\t      - Yes*\n556\t    - - Mistral-7B\n557\t      - Trigger F1\n558\t      - '+1.50'\n559\t      - '[-0.6, +3.6]'\n560\t      - '0.15'\n561\t      - 'No'\n562\t    - - Mistral-7B\n563\t      - Entity F1\n564\t      - '+11.71'\n565\t      - '[+8.2, +15.2]'\n566\t      - <0.001\n567\t      - Yes*\n568\t  figures_description:\n569\t  - 'Forest plot: F1 deltas with 95% CI bars, trigger CIs crossing zero (not significant),\n570\t    entity CIs well above zero but asterisked as ''format compliance effect'''\n571\t  analysis: 'worst tier 下 bootstrap CI 反而帮了倒忙：它精确量化了 \"trigger F1 improvement is not\n572\t    significant\"，给审稿人提供了弹药。Entity F1 的显著性被 \"format compliance\" 解释完全化解——不是方法带来了 semantic\n573\t    improvement，而是 grammar enforcement 让 parser 能工作了。 建议论文中如实报告 CI，但 framing 为 \"F1\n574\t    is a control variable (C8), not an optimization target。Significance testing confirms\n575\t    constraints do not degrade trigger detection while restoring entity parsability。\"\n576\t    避免把 entity F1 improvement 作为 selling point。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t- name: Latency overhead measurement (DocRED)\n580\t  plan_id: P035\n581\t  description: 'Wall-clock comparison for DocRED constrained vs unconstrained decoding。\n582\t    SciERC 已完成（p8: overhead 13.1%）。DocRED (p8b) 正在运行。\n583\t\n584\t    '\n585\t  expected_results:\n586\t    docred_unconstrained_mean_s: 8.9\n587\t    docred_unconstrained_median_s: 8.5\n588\t    docred_constrained_mean_s: 11.2\n589\t    docred_constrained_median_s: 10.7\n590\t    docred_overhead_ratio_mean: 1.258\n591\t    docred_overhead_pct: 25.8\n592\t    docred_overhead_p95_perdoc: 1.42\n593\t    docred_constrained_total_hours: 3.1\n594\t    ee_estimated_overhead_pct: 32.0\n595\t    scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n596\t    docred_overhead_pct_final: 25.8\n597\t    overhead_scales_with_schema_size: true\n598\t  result_rationale: \"SciERC overhead 13.1%（7 relation types, ~350 constraint rules）。DocRED\\\n599\t    \\ 预期更高：\\n(1) DocRED 96 relation types → grammar CFG 更大（~5x token count in grammar\\\n600\t    \\ definition），XGrammar compilation overhead per-token 增加； (2) Semantic mask lookup\\\n601\t    \\ table 96×N entries vs 7×N → per-token mask computation 更重； (3) 更关键：DocRED 文档更长（平均\\\n602\t    \\ ~200 tokens input, output ~800 tokens）， semantic layer 的 entity registry 累积更多\\\n603\t    \\ entries → lookup 时间随 generation length 线性增长； (4) 预期 overhead 25.8%——比 SciERC\\\n604\t    \\ 翻倍但仍在 single-digit seconds per doc 内； (5) P95 per-doc overhead 1.42x（部分文档 entity\\\n605\t    \\ registry 很大，mask computation spike）；\\nworst tier 审稿人反应： - \\\"25.8% overhead on\\\n606\t    \\ DocRED, estimated 32% on EE with 56 event types × 80 roles。\\n  At 70B scale,\\\n607\t    \\ generation is already slow (~30s per doc), adding 25% means\\n  ~37.5s per doc.\\\n608\t    \\ For a method that only removes 1.5pp of violations at 70B scale,\\n  this overhead-to-benefit\\\n609\t    \\ ratio is poor.\\\"\\n- \\\"Overhead scales with schema complexity — for production\\\n610\t    \\ KGs with hundreds of\\n  types, overhead could exceed 50%. The paper doesn't\\\n611\t    \\ analyze scaling behavior.\\\"\\n\\n防御：overhead 只影响 decoding-time（不影响 training），且只在\\\n612\t    \\ type token positions 有 mask computation（free text tokens 无额外开销）。25.8% 是 wall-clock\\\n613\t    \\ 包含 all tokens 的 amortized overhead，type-token-only overhead 可能 >100% 但 amortized\\\n614\t    \\ 后 acceptable。论文中应报告 per-type-token overhead 和 amortized overhead 两个维度。\\n\"\n615\t  tables:\n616\t  - name: 'Table: Latency Overhead Across Datasets'\n617\t    columns:\n618\t    - Dataset\n619\t    - Schema Size\n620\t    - Uncon (s/doc)\n621\t    - Con (s/doc)\n622\t    - Overhead %\n623\t    - P95 Overhead\n624\t    rows:\n625\t    - - SciERC (actual)\n626\t      - 7 rels\n627\t      - '4.16'\n628\t      - '4.71'\n629\t      - 13.1%\n630\t      - 26.2%\n631\t    - - DocRED (predicted)\n632\t      - 96 rels\n633\t      - '8.9'\n634\t      - '11.2'\n635\t      - 25.8%\n636\t      - 42.0%\n637\t    - - WikiEvents (est.)\n638\t      - 56 evt × 80 roles\n639\t      - ~12\n640\t      - ~15.8\n641\t      - ~32%\n642\t      - ~48%\n643\t  figures_description:\n644\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-document overhead ratio vs document length (tokens), showing\n645\t    weak positive correlation — longer docs have slightly higher overhead due to entity\n646\t    registry growth'\n647\t  analysis: latency overhead 在 worst tier 下是辅助攻击面（不致命但 additive）。主要问题： overhead 随\n648\t    schema complexity 增长，论文只测了 7-type 和 96-type，审稿人质疑 scalability。防御：overhead 主要来自\n649\t    mask computation 而非 grammar compilation （compilation 是 one-time），mask 计算是 O(|allowed_types|)\n650\t    per type-token position， 在 GPU 上可并行。但 worst tier 下审稿人不接受 theoretical argument，要求\n651\t    empirical scaling curve（需要 synthetic ontologies of varying sizes，deadline 前 不可能做）。\n652\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"868768b3-db3e-406d-8db5-3414a391d999","uuid":"7c7b1185-1efd-48d5-8b7f-aeeeb3db5372","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:31:06.064Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T162745/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心叙事需要从 \"method paper with empirical validation\" 重构为 \"empirical\n  study with method validation\"。 三个 reframe 策略组合使用：(A) Violation Landscape 升级为论文主体贡献——70B\n  低违规反而是 positive finding （\"scale partially mitigates but task complexity determines\n  violation severity — EE RoV 64-89% regardless of model size\"）；(B) prefix-decidability\n  taxonomy formalize 为 theorem；(C) FT composability 作为 practical selling point（\"decoding-time\n  type checking for neural generation\"）。 worst 档下审稿人平均分 2.75-3.25（Borderline Findings），核心攻击面：70B\n  近乎消除违规使方法动机被 削弱；novelty 仍被视为 incremental；CF 15-21% 在 EE 上被标记为 \"method introduces\n  more problems than it solves\"。需要 rebuttal 期全面回应 + AC meta-review 争取 Findings 录用。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\n  plan_id: P029\n  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on SciERC 551 docs。已完成，实际结果需在 worst\n    tier 下解读。 实际结果：unconstrained DR=6.5%, constrained DR=0%, CF=3.66%。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    70b_scierc_uncon_DR_pct: 6.5\n    70b_scierc_uncon_RV_pct: 0.6\n    70b_scierc_uncon_ET_pct: 0\n    70b_scierc_uncon_R_F1: 11.22\n    70b_scierc_uncon_E_F1: 35.17\n    70b_scierc_con_DR_pct: 0.0\n    70b_scierc_con_RV_pct: 0.0\n    70b_scierc_con_CF_pct: 3.66\n    70b_scierc_con_R_F1: 11.24\n    70b_scierc_con_E_F1: 35.14\n    DR_reduction_pct: 100.0\n    R_F1_delta_pp: 0.02\n    E_F1_delta_pp: -0.03\n  result_rationale: '70B SciERC 结果对 worst tier 叙事是双刃剑。一方面，unconstrained DR=6.5% 远低于\n    8B 的 15.4% （Qwen）和 13.3%（Llama-8B），证明 scale 确实大幅缓解违规。另一方面，6.5% 仍非零——7 个 relation\n    type 中 constraint tightness 高的（Feature-of τ=0.143, Compare τ=0.194）在 70B 下 仍有残留违规。审稿人会抓住\n    \"6.5%→0% 在 SciERC 是有意义的\"，但随即质问 \"DocRED 呢？\"。 worst tier 下 SciERC 被视为 cherry-pick（小\n    ontology，tight constraints 人为放大违规率）， DocRED 才是 litmus test。CF=3.66% 比 8B（Qwen\n    9.9%）低但仍非零，审稿人认为 \"even at 70B scale, the method still introduces new violation\n    types (CF)\"。 R_F1 delta +0.02pp 在 noise 范围内——无法声明 F1 improvement，只能声明 neutral。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 70B SciERC Cross-Scale Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Scale\n    - DR%↓\n    - RV%\n    - ET%\n    - CF%\n    - R-F1\n    - ΔR-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 8B\n      - 15.37→0.93 (↓94%)\n      - 1.39→0\n      - 0.40→0\n      - 0.08→9.90\n      - 8.23→8.36\n      - '+0.13'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 8B\n      - 13.34→0.08 (↓99%)\n      - 0.55→0\n      - 0→0\n      - 0.49→6.56\n      - 2.68→2.54\n      - '-0.14'\n    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n      - 70B\n      - 6.50→0.00 (↓100%)\n      - 0.60→0\n      - 0→0\n      - 0→3.66\n      - 11.22→11.24\n      - '+0.02'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: DR% by model scale (8B Qwen, 8B Llama, 70B Llama) showing monotonic\n    decrease with scale, constrained overlay showing all near-zero'\n  analysis: 'worst tier 审稿人解读：SciERC unconstrained DR 从 8B 的 13-15% 降至 70B 的 6.5%，\n    自然 scaling 已削减 50-57%。OntoCoDec 将剩余 6.5%→0%（绝对 Δ=6.5pp）， 但审稿人可能认为 \"this remaining\n    6.5% would likely disappear at 405B or with better prompting\"。防线：指出 DR=6.5% 仍然意味着\n    97 个 triples 含有结构性违规， 下游 KG 不可用。但此防线在 DocRED 上会崩溃（见 P030）。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\n  plan_id: P030\n  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on DocRED 998 docs。 8B baseline: Qwen\n    DR=18.46%, Llama-8B DR=26.07%。 worst tier 预测 70B unconstrained DR 在 0.5-3.0% 之间，constrained\n    0-0.5%。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    70b_docred_uncon_DR_pct: 1.8\n    70b_docred_uncon_RV_pct: 2.3\n    70b_docred_uncon_ET_pct: 0.0\n    70b_docred_uncon_CF_pct: 0.04\n    70b_docred_uncon_parse_fail_rate: 2.1\n    70b_docred_uncon_E_F1: 64.2\n    70b_docred_uncon_E_P: 63.8\n    70b_docred_uncon_E_R: 64.6\n    70b_docred_uncon_R_F1: 10.1\n    70b_docred_uncon_R_P: 8.6\n    70b_docred_uncon_R_R: 12.3\n    70b_docred_uncon_total_triples: 17200\n    70b_docred_con_DR_pct: 0.3\n    70b_docred_con_RV_pct: 0.0\n    70b_docred_con_ET_pct: 0.0\n    70b_docred_con_CF_pct: 3.8\n    70b_docred_con_parse_fail_rate: 2.8\n    70b_docred_con_E_F1: 64.0\n    70b_docred_con_E_P: 63.5\n    70b_docred_con_E_R: 64.5\n    70b_docred_con_R_F1: 9.9\n    70b_docred_con_R_P: 8.4\n    70b_docred_con_R_R: 12.1\n    70b_docred_DR_reduction_pct: 83.3\n    70b_docred_R_F1_delta_pp: -0.2\n    70b_docred_E_F1_delta_pp: -0.2\n    70b_docred_absolute_DR_delta_pp: 1.5\n    70b_docred_DR_eligible_triples_with_violations_uncon: ~265\n    70b_docred_DR_eligible_triples_with_violations_con: ~44\n  result_rationale: '70B DocRED 是 worst tier 的核心打击点。预测 unconstrained DR=1.8%，基于以下推理：\n    (1) 8B→70B SciERC DR 从 13.3%→6.5%（↓51%），但 SciERC 只有 7 types 且 constraint tightness\n    更高（τ̄=0.571），70B 的 distributional prior 仍频繁违反 tight constraints； (2) DocRED 96\n    types，τ̄=0.842（loose），大多数 relation 的 domain/range 覆盖多种 entity type——70B 的更好 type\n    assignment 能力在 loose constraints 下几乎不违规； (3) 对标 FT 场景：Qwen FT DocRED DR=0.76%，Llama\n    FT DocRED DR=0.49%——FT 让 8B 模型 \"学会\" schema，70B 的 in-context learning 能力接近但略弱于\n    FT，预期 DR 在 1-3% 区间； (4) RV=2.3% 远低于 8B 的 16-30%，因为 70B 对 96 个 relation name 的\n    recall 更强—— 但仍有少量 paraphrase/abbreviation（如 P710_participant → \"participant_in\"）；\n    (5) Constrained DR=0.3% 因为 70B 本身违规少，semantic mask 的 fallback 频率极低 （估计 <5 次/doc\n    vs Llama-8B 的 57 次/doc），几乎所有 token 位置 semantic mask 生效； (6) R_F1 delta=-0.2pp\n    因为 70B 的 RV baseline 已很低（2.3%），grammar 层消除 OOV 带来的 FP reduction 微乎其微（对比 Qwen-8B\n    RV=29.66% → grammar 消除产生显著 F1 提升）； (7) CF=3.8% 比 8B 低但仍存在——semantic layer 的 per-relation\n    independent type enforcement 在 70B 上仍产生 cross-relation inconsistency，只是频率更低； (8)\n    Parse fail rate 2.1-2.8% 比 Llama-8B (6.8-9.1%) 低，70B 指令遵循能力更强。\n\n    审稿人攻击线：\"70B unconstrained DR=1.8%，your method brings it to 0.3% — a 1.5pp absolute\n    improvement on a 17000-triple dataset means ~265→44 violating triples。 This is\n    a marginal cleanup, not a methodological contribution。At this scale, better prompting\n    or a 405B model would likely eliminate the remaining 1.8% entirely。\"\n\n    更致命的是百分比 reduction 虽为 83.3%，但审稿人会指出 \"83% reduction of 1.8% is 1.5 percentage points\n    — statistically indistinguishable from noise on individual documents\"。 这与 Qwen-8B\n    DocRED 的 18.46%→10.21% (Δ=8.25pp) 形成鲜明对比。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 70B DocRED Cross-Scale DR Trajectory'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Uncon DR%\n    - Con DR%\n    - Absolute Δ\n    - Relative ↓%\n    - ΔR-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '18.46'\n      - '10.21'\n      - 8.25pp\n      - 44.7%\n      - '+0.50'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '26.07'\n      - '2.55'\n      - 23.52pp\n      - 90.2%\n      - '+0.29'\n    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n      - '1.8'\n      - '0.3'\n      - 1.5pp\n      - 83.3%\n      - '-0.2'\n  - name: 'Table: 70B DocRED Full Violation Profile'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - ET%\n    - RV%\n    - DR%\n    - CF%\n    - E-F1\n    - R-F1\n    - Parse%\n    rows:\n    - - 70B unconstrained\n      - '0.0'\n      - '2.3'\n      - '1.8'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '64.2'\n      - '10.1'\n      - '97.9'\n    - - 70B constrained\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '9.9'\n      - '97.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: DR% vs model scale (8B Qwen, 8B Llama, 70B Llama) for DocRED, showing\n    exponential decay — unconstrained DR drops from ~22% average at 8B to <2% at 70B,\n    undermining the motivation for decoding-time constraint enforcement'\n  - 'Stacked bar: Absolute violation count (not rate) at 70B — showing ~265 unconstrained\n    → ~44 constrained, visually small numbers on a 17K-triple base'\n  analysis: \"这是 worst tier 的致命攻击面。审稿人会构建如下论证链： (1) \\\"Violations are a scaling phenomenon:\\\n    \\ 8B→70B reduces DR by 86-93% on DocRED without any method intervention\\\"; (2)\\\n    \\ \\\"The residual 1.8% at 70B is within the range achievable by prompt engineering\\\n    \\ (schema-informed prompt on 8B already achieves DR↓32%, better prompting on 70B\\\n    \\ should do more)\\\"; (3) \\\"OntoCoDec's absolute contribution at 70B is 1.5pp —\\\n    \\ smaller than the confidence interval of most IE metrics\\\"; (4) \\\"Meanwhile,\\\n    \\ the method introduces CF violations (0.04%→3.8%), creating a new problem to\\\n    \\ solve a vanishing one\\\"。\\n防御策略（reframe A 为主）： - 不争论 70B 数字本身，承认 \\\"scale partially\\\n    \\ mitigates violations on loose-constraint\\n  ontologies\\\" 作为 positive finding\\n\\\n    - 将论点转向 task complexity：SciERC 70B DR=6.5%（tight constraints 下 scale 不够），\\n  EE\\\n    \\ RoV=64-89%（role constraints 下 scale 完全无效）\\n- 70B DocRED 低 DR 恰好证明 \\\"tightness\\\n    \\ determines violation severity\\\" 的理论 claim——\\n  DocRED τ̄=0.842 是 loose ontology\\\n    \\ 的代表，结论是 \\\"loose ontology + large model = low\\n  violation, but tight ontology\\\n    \\ or complex task structure requires enforcement regardless\\n  of scale\\\"\\n- 但审稿人可能不买账：worst\\\n    \\ tier 下 2/3 审稿人仍标记 novelty incremental\\n\"\n- name: Error analysis / case study (EE + RE)\n  plan_id: P031\n  description: '10-20 representative cases from WikiEvents v3 EE results + DocRED\n    RE residuals。 分析 AC residual root causes, CF systematic patterns, qualitative\n    evidence for paper。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ee_ac_residual_cases_analyzed: 15\n    ee_ac_root_cause_semantic_confusion_pct: 72\n    ee_ac_root_cause_annotation_ambiguity_pct: 18\n    ee_ac_root_cause_tokenizer_residual_pct: 10\n    ee_cf_pattern_top1: same entity assigned PER in one event and SID in another\n    ee_cf_pattern_top2: GPE vs FAC for location-type arguments across co-located events\n    ee_cf_pattern_top3: ORG vs SID for group entities in Movement vs Conflict events\n    ee_cf_systematic_type_pair_count: 5\n    re_docred_residual_dr_per_relation_top3:\n    - 'P31_instance_of: DR still ~3-5% even at constrained'\n    - 'P17_country: loose constraint but edge-case entity types'\n    - 'P131_located_in: GPE vs LOC boundary confusion'\n    qualitative_insight_novelty: low\n  result_rationale: 'worst tier 下 error analysis 不会产生 surprising findings。AC 残留（Qwen\n    2.1%, Llama 3.8%, Mistral 1.3%）的根因已在 BPE collision diagnostic 中部分解释： Mistral 有\n    2 个 collision group 贡献了大部分 AC，Qwen/Llama 0 collision 但仍有 AC， 说明是模型本身的 semantic\n    confusion（如 SID vs SEN 语义相近，模型难以在 constrained 空间中区分）。分析 15 个 case 后，预期 72% 属于\n    \"similar entity types that the model confuses under constraint pressure\"（如 PER/SID/SEN\n    在 WikiEvents 中语义重叠）， 18% 属于 annotation 本身的 ambiguity（gold label 也可争议），10% 是 tokenizer\n    residual（collision fix 后仍有边缘 case）。 CF 分析会揭示与 RE CF 相同的模式：type system 语义边界模糊导致同一\n    entity 在 不同 event context 中被合理归类为不同 type。但 worst tier 审稿人不接受 \"type ambiguity 解释\"——认为这是\n    method limitation 而非 type system 问题。 qualitative insight 缺乏 novelty：所有发现都是 \"method\n    works as designed, residuals are expected boundary cases\"，不会产生 \"我没想到\" 的 insight。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Case study figure: 2-3 annotated examples showing AC residual (entity type confusion\n    under constraint), CF pattern (cross-event type drift), and one success case (constraint\n    correctly preventing invalid argument assignment)'\n  analysis: 'error analysis 在 worst tier 下是 necessary but not sufficient。审稿人 comment：\n    \"The error analysis confirms that residual violations are due to model confusion\n    between semantically similar types, which is expected. The CF analysis shows the\n    method systematically introduces a new violation category. Neither finding is\n    surprising or provides actionable insight for improving the method.\" 防御：将 error\n    analysis 定位为 \"empirical validation of the decidability taxonomy\" ——AC residuals\n    是 category (b) constraints 的 boundary cases，CF 是 category (c) non-local constraints\n    的 concrete manifestation。但这在 worst tier 下仅获得 \"adequate but not compelling\" 评价。\n\n    '\n- name: EE FT composability\n  plan_id: P032\n  description: 'Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents Event Extraction。 验证 FT\n    regime 下 constrained decoding 的 composability。 估算 ~30 GPU-hours，仅时间允许时执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ee_ft_uncon_EV_pct: 0.5\n    ee_ft_uncon_RoV_pct: 8.2\n    ee_ft_uncon_AC_pct: 0.4\n    ee_ft_uncon_CF_pct: 0.1\n    ee_ft_uncon_trigger_f1: 62.5\n    ee_ft_uncon_argument_f1: 38.0\n    ee_ft_uncon_entity_f1: 71.3\n    ee_ft_con_EV_pct: 0.0\n    ee_ft_con_RoV_pct: 0.0\n    ee_ft_con_AC_pct: 0.1\n    ee_ft_con_CF_pct: 1.8\n    ee_ft_con_trigger_f1: 62.3\n    ee_ft_con_argument_f1: 37.8\n    ee_ft_con_entity_f1: 71.0\n    RoV_reduction_pct: 100.0\n    AC_reduction_pct: 75.0\n    argument_f1_delta_pp: -0.2\n    ee_ft_total_violations_uncon_pct: 9.2\n    ee_ft_total_violations_con_pct: 1.9\n  result_rationale: \"FT composability 在 RE 上已验证（Qwen DocRED: DR 0.76%→0.01%, R_F1\\\n    \\ -0.30pp； Llama DocRED: DR 0.49%→0.20%, R_F1 +0.51pp）。EE FT 预期模式类似但更复杂：\\n(1)\\\n    \\ FT 大幅降低 EV 和 RoV（模型学会了 event type 和 role vocabulary），预期 EV 0.5%、RoV 8.2%（比 ZS\\\n    \\ 的 24-37% 和 64-89% 大幅下降但不为零——EE 的 56 event types × 80 roles 比 RE 的 96 relation\\\n    \\ types 更复杂，长尾 event types 训练样本不足）； (2) AC 从 ZS 的 0-3.8% 降至 0.4%（FT 改善 entity\\\n    \\ type assignment）； (3) Constrained 消除所有 EV/RoV（grammar+semantic 层直接生效），AC 降至\\\n    \\ 0.1%； (4) CF 从 0.1%→1.8%（semantic layer 引入的系统性副作用，但比 ZS 的 14-21% 低很多—— FT 模型本身更一致，cross-event\\\n    \\ type drift 减少）； (5) F1 基本 neutral（delta <0.5pp），因为 FT 模型 RoV baseline 已低，grammar/semantic\\\n    \\ 消除 OOV 带来的 FP reduction 有限。\\nworst tier 审稿人反应： - \\\"FT regime is the realistic\\\n    \\ deployment scenario. FT already reduces violations\\n  to <10%. The additional\\\n    \\ 7pp reduction from OntoCoDec (9.2%→1.9%) is useful but\\n  incremental — the\\\n    \\ heavy lifting is done by fine-tuning, not your method.\\\"\\n- \\\"F1 delta is negative\\\n    \\ (-0.2pp), so the method doesn't even preserve quality.\\\" - 但 \\\"decoding-time\\\n    \\ type checking\\\" angle 对 industry reviewers 仍有吸引力\\n  （类比 static typing for neural\\\n    \\ generation），这是 reframe C 的核心卖点。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: EE FT Composability (WikiEvents, Qwen3-8B)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - EV%\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    - CF%\n    - Trig-F1\n    - Arg-F1\n    - Ent-F1\n    rows:\n    - - FT unconstrained\n      - '0.5'\n      - '8.2'\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '62.5'\n      - '38.0'\n      - '71.3'\n    - - FT constrained\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '1.8'\n      - '62.3'\n      - '37.8'\n      - '71.0'\n    - - ZS unconstrained (ref)\n      - '24.0'\n      - '74.9'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '11.8'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - ZS constrained (ref)\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '21.1'\n      - '13.4'\n      - '1.7'\n      - '14.1'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'worst tier 下 EE FT composability 是 reframe C 的关键支撑。即使审稿人质疑 ZS 场景的 practical\n    relevance，FT 结果展示 \"even well-trained models benefit from decoding-time type checking\"。但攻击面是\n    F1 delta 为负——虽然微小（-0.2pp），在 worst tier 下会被 放大为 \"method degrades the model it''s\n    supposed to help\"。 如果时间不够（May 25 前），此实验可能无法完成。没有此数据，论文缺少 EE+FT 交叉 验证，reframe C\n    在 EE 维度的支撑变弱。建议如果必须砍实验，保留 RE FT 数据即可， EE FT 降级为 future work，但这会被审稿人标记为 \"incomplete\n    evaluation\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\n  plan_id: P033\n  description: 'WikiEvents grammar_only ablation on Qwen3-8B 和 Llama-3.1-8B， 补全 Mistral\n    grammar_only v3 已有的消融证据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0.0\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 71.5\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_AC_pct: 8.4\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.2\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_trigger_f1: 12.8\n    qwen_ee_grammar_only_entity_f1: 0.5\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0.0\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 77.2\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_AC_pct: 11.6\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.1\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_trigger_f1: 6.9\n    llama_ee_grammar_only_entity_f1: 1.2\n    grammar_only_RoV_range: 64-77%\n    grammar_only_AC_surfacing_range: 8-14%\n    semantic_layer_necessity_confirmed: true\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral grammar_only v3 已显示：EV→0%, RoV=64%, AC=13.8%, CF=1.1%。\n    Qwen 和 Llama grammar_only 预期模式一致但具体数值因模型特性不同：\n\n    (1) EV→0%（所有模型）：grammar CFG 限制 event type vocabulary 是确定性消除； (2) RoV 71.5%（Qwen）和\n    77.2%（Llama）：grammar CFG 无法 enforce context-dependent role constraints（需要知道当前\n    event type 才能确定 allowed roles），这是 structural limitation 不是 implementation bug。Llama\n    RoV 更高是因为 Llama unconstrained baseline RoV=88.8% > Qwen 74.9%——grammar 消除 EV 后暴露更多\n    latent RoV violations （与 RE 中 grammar 暴露 latent DR 的模式完全对应）； (3) AC 8.4-11.6%：grammar-only\n    下 RoV 仍高 → 很多 role assignment 是 OOV → valid role 的 AC check 基于 grammar 强制匹配的 role（可能不是模型意图的\n    role） → AC 升高。与 Mistral 的 13.8% 一致； (4) CF 极低（0.1-0.2%）：grammar 不引入 cross-event\n    type drift，CF 主要来自 semantic layer 的 per-event independent enforcement。\n\n    worst tier 审稿人反应：\"Grammar CFG cannot handle context-dependent constraints — this\n    is obvious from the CFG formalism itself. Demonstrating it empirically on 3 models\n    adds confirmation but not insight. The real question is whether the semantic layer\n    is novel, and it''s just a lookup table with logit masking.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Grammar-only Ablation Cross-Model (WikiEvents EE)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - EV%\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    - CF%\n    - Ent-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B grammar_only\n      - '0'\n      - '71.5'\n      - '8.4'\n      - '0.2'\n      - '0.5'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B grammar_only\n      - '0'\n      - '77.2'\n      - '11.6'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '1.2'\n    - - Mistral-7B grammar_only (actual)\n      - '0'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.1'\n      - '11.9'\n    - - Qwen3-8B full_s1 (ref)\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '21.1'\n      - '14.1'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B full_s1 (ref)\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '17.2'\n      - '17.6'\n    - - Mistral-7B full_s1 (ref)\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.3'\n      - '14.9'\n      - '11.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar: RoV% under grammar_only vs full_s1 across 3 models, showing semantic\n    layer reduces RoV from 64-77% to 0%'\n  analysis: '消融结果 mechanically confirms semantic layer necessity，但 worst tier 审稿人\n    认为 \"this is a predictable result from the method design, not an empirical finding\"。\n    此实验的价值在于 completeness（审稿人不能攻击 \"only tested grammar_only on one model\"）， 但对 novelty\n    评分无贡献。优先级 Tier 3 合理——如果时间紧可以只报 Mistral（已有）， Qwen/Llama 放 appendix 或省略。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\n  plan_id: P034\n  description: '10000-iteration bootstrap CI for WikiEvents EE F1 changes (constrained\n    vs unconstrained, 3 models)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.55\n    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.08\n    qwen_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n    - -0.2\n    - 3.3\n    qwen_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 14.09\n    qwen_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n    qwen_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n    - 10.5\n    - 17.8\n    llama_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.76\n    llama_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.12\n    llama_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n    - -0.5\n    - 4.0\n    llama_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 17.63\n    llama_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n    llama_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n    - 13.8\n    - 21.5\n    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.5\n    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_p_value: 0.15\n    mistral_ee_trigger_f1_ci_95:\n    - -0.6\n    - 3.6\n    mistral_ee_entity_f1_delta_pp: 11.71\n    mistral_ee_entity_f1_p_value: 0.001\n    mistral_ee_entity_f1_ci_95:\n    - 8.2\n    - 15.2\n    trigger_f1_significant_count: 0/3\n    entity_f1_significant_count: 3/3\n    argument_f1_too_low_for_ci: true\n  result_rationale: 'Bootstrap CI 预测基于以下分析：\n\n    (1) Entity F1 从 0%→11-18% 的改变在所有模型上都 highly significant（p<0.001）。 但审稿人会 dismiss\n    这个结果：\"Entity F1 going from 0% to 14% is not a semantic improvement — it''s format\n    compliance. Without grammar enforcement, the JSON output is so malformed that\n    the parser can''t extract entities at all. This is measuring parser compatibility,\n    not extraction quality.\" 这是准确的——unconstrained 的 entity_f1=0% 是因为 parser 无法识别 non-schema\n    entity types，不是因为 entity spans 不正确。\n\n    (2) Trigger F1 delta 1.5-1.8pp 在所有模型上都 NOT significant（p=0.08-0.15）。 246 docs\n    样本量下，trigger 级别的 bootstrap variance 较大（每个 doc 平均 只有 ~2-3 trigger mentions），CI\n    跨越零。worst tier 审稿人：\"Trigger F1 improvement is within noise — the method doesn''t\n    improve event detection.\"\n\n    (3) Argument F1 太低（0.3-1.7%）无法做有意义的 CI——bootstrap 在此量级下 方差占比过高，CI 宽度 > point estimate。\n\n    (4) worst tier 关键：所有 \"显著\" 的 F1 improvement 都来自 format compliance 而非 semantic improvement。审稿人\n    framing：\"If your contribution is making JSON parseable, that''s an engineering\n    contribution, not a research contribution.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bootstrap CI for EE F1 (10000 iterations)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Metric\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    - Significant?\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - Trigger F1\n      - '+1.55'\n      - '[-0.2, +3.3]'\n      - '0.08'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - Entity F1\n      - '+14.09'\n      - '[+10.5, +17.8]'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - Trigger F1\n      - '+1.76'\n      - '[-0.5, +4.0]'\n      - '0.12'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - Entity F1\n      - '+17.63'\n      - '[+13.8, +21.5]'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - Trigger F1\n      - '+1.50'\n      - '[-0.6, +3.6]'\n      - '0.15'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - Entity F1\n      - '+11.71'\n      - '[+8.2, +15.2]'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: F1 deltas with 95% CI bars, trigger CIs crossing zero (not significant),\n    entity CIs well above zero but asterisked as ''format compliance effect'''\n  analysis: 'worst tier 下 bootstrap CI 反而帮了倒忙：它精确量化了 \"trigger F1 improvement is not\n    significant\"，给审稿人提供了弹药。Entity F1 的显著性被 \"format compliance\" 解释完全化解——不是方法带来了 semantic\n    improvement，而是 grammar enforcement 让 parser 能工作了。 建议论文中如实报告 CI，但 framing 为 \"F1\n    is a control variable (C8), not an optimization target。Significance testing confirms\n    constraints do not degrade trigger detection while restoring entity parsability。\"\n    避免把 entity F1 improvement 作为 selling point。\n\n    '\n- name: Latency overhead measurement (DocRED)\n  plan_id: P035\n  description: 'Wall-clock comparison for DocRED constrained vs unconstrained decoding。\n    SciERC 已完成（p8: overhead 13.1%）。DocRED (p8b) 正在运行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    docred_unconstrained_mean_s: 8.9\n    docred_unconstrained_median_s: 8.5\n    docred_constrained_mean_s: 11.2\n    docred_constrained_median_s: 10.7\n    docred_overhead_ratio_mean: 1.258\n    docred_overhead_pct: 25.8\n    docred_overhead_p95_perdoc: 1.42\n    docred_constrained_total_hours: 3.1\n    ee_estimated_overhead_pct: 32.0\n    scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n    docred_overhead_pct_final: 25.8\n    overhead_scales_with_schema_size: true\n  result_rationale: \"SciERC overhead 13.1%（7 relation types, ~350 constraint rules）。DocRED\\\n    \\ 预期更高：\\n(1) DocRED 96 relation types → grammar CFG 更大（~5x token count in grammar\\\n    \\ definition），XGrammar compilation overhead per-token 增加； (2) Semantic mask lookup\\\n    \\ table 96×N entries vs 7×N → per-token mask computation 更重； (3) 更关键：DocRED 文档更长（平均\\\n    \\ ~200 tokens input, output ~800 tokens）， semantic layer 的 entity registry 累积更多\\\n    \\ entries → lookup 时间随 generation length 线性增长； (4) 预期 overhead 25.8%——比 SciERC\\\n    \\ 翻倍但仍在 single-digit seconds per doc 内； (5) P95 per-doc overhead 1.42x（部分文档 entity\\\n    \\ registry 很大，mask computation spike）；\\nworst tier 审稿人反应： - \\\"25.8% overhead on\\\n    \\ DocRED, estimated 32% on EE with 56 event types × 80 roles。\\n  At 70B scale,\\\n    \\ generation is already slow (~30s per doc), adding 25% means\\n  ~37.5s per doc.\\\n    \\ For a method that only removes 1.5pp of violations at 70B scale,\\n  this overhead-to-benefit\\\n    \\ ratio is poor.\\\"\\n- \\\"Overhead scales with schema complexity — for production\\\n    \\ KGs with hundreds of\\n  types, overhead could exceed 50%. The paper doesn't\\\n    \\ analyze scaling behavior.\\\"\\n\\n防御：overhead 只影响 decoding-time（不影响 training），且只在\\\n    \\ type token positions 有 mask computation（free text tokens 无额外开销）。25.8% 是 wall-clock\\\n    \\ 包含 all tokens 的 amortized overhead，type-token-only overhead 可能 >100% 但 amortized\\\n    \\ 后 acceptable。论文中应报告 per-type-token overhead 和 amortized overhead 两个维度。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Latency Overhead Across Datasets'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Schema Size\n    - Uncon (s/doc)\n    - Con (s/doc)\n    - Overhead %\n    - P95 Overhead\n    rows:\n    - - SciERC (actual)\n      - 7 rels\n      - '4.16'\n      - '4.71'\n      - 13.1%\n      - 26.2%\n    - - DocRED (predicted)\n      - 96 rels\n      - '8.9'\n      - '11.2'\n      - 25.8%\n      - 42.0%\n    - - WikiEvents (est.)\n      - 56 evt × 80 roles\n      - ~12\n      - ~15.8\n      - ~32%\n      - ~48%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-document overhead ratio vs document length (tokens), showing\n    weak positive correlation — longer docs have slightly higher overhead due to entity\n    registry growth'\n  analysis: latency overhead 在 worst tier 下是辅助攻击面（不致命但 additive）。主要问题： overhead 随\n    schema complexity 增长，论文只测了 7-type 和 96-type，审稿人质疑 scalability。防御：overhead 主要来自\n    mask computation 而非 grammar compilation （compilation 是 one-time），mask 计算是 O(|allowed_types|)\n    per type-token position， 在 GPU 上可并行。但 worst tier 下审稿人不接受 theoretical argument，要求\n    empirical scaling curve（需要 synthetic ontologies of varying sizes，deadline 前 不可能做）。\n","numLines":652,"startLine":1,"totalLines":652}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HPJYJFgs1nY8qyPEiE65Da","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the paper and review context carefully, then dispatch two reviewers for the full review process.\n\nThe paper is about ontology constraint violations in LLM-based information extraction, proposing a prefix-decidability taxonomy and OntoCoDec system. Let me now dispatch R1 (method + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work) as parallel agents.\n\nLet me first understand what I need to do:\n1. Dispatch R1 (method + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work) as parallel agents\n2. Conduct a full roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize\n\n\n3. Submit the final review report\n\nNow I'll set up the two reviewers to work in parallel on their respective areas.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32697,"cache_read_input_tokens":24516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32697},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"868768b3-db3e-406d-8db5-3414a391d999","uuid":"2d82864b-db0e-4f3a-be68-f5a39f4b6f18"}
