{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TzMTH19y9x6QKiWBayDJdV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema_semantic_constrained_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-18 13:15 UTC | 更新原因: Round 6 审稿结果 3.5 + Action Matrix 定稿 + Q1 优先于 P3 (D054)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nOntoCoDec: 两层约束解码（grammar + semantic）自动编译 IE ontology schema 为 token-level constraints，消除 LLM-based IE 的 ontology constraint violations。**目标: EMNLP 2026 conference main**（ARR May 25）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n**阶段**: Round 6 审稿修复中 + 70B 实验运行中\\\\n\\\\n**Round 6 审稿**: 3.5 Borderline Conference（Reviewer 称修 MF1 后可接近 4.0）\\\\n- 1 个新 critical (MF1: \\\\\\\"zero violations\\\\\\\" overclaim) — Paper Agent 修复中\\\\n- 3 个携带 warning (SF1 beam/SF2 -ing/SF3 DocRED coverage) — Paper Agent 修复中\\\\n- Round 5 的 2 critical + 5 warning 全部 resolved ✅\\\\n\\\\n**RE 实验**: 70+ 实验全部完成（SciERC + DocRED, 3 models, full ablation matrix）\\\\n\\\\n**WikiEvents EE v3**: 全部完成 ✅（3 models × 246 docs, RoV=0%, AC 1.3-3.8%）\\\\n\\\\n**70B 实验**: 4/4 GPU 运行中\\\\n- westd-21461: SciERC unconstrained (pid=24552) + constrained (pid=24703)\\\\n- westd-16980: DocRED unconstrained (pid=556552) + constrained (pid=556631)\\\\n\\\\n## Conference Main 补强计划（D049, 更新 D054）\\\\n\\\\n### Tier 1 — 必做 🔴\\\\n- [ ] **P1: 70B 模型实验** — 4 卡全部运行中\\\\n- [x] **P2: EE post-hoc baseline** ✅\\\\n- [ ] **Q1: Llama SciERC LoRA+beam k=4** — 70B 后最高优先级（影响 Abstract claim 强度）\\\\n- [ ] **P3: Error analysis / case study** — Q1 之后\\\\n\\\\n### Round 6 审稿修复 — Paper Agent 执行中\\\\n- [ ] MF1: \\\\\\\"zero violations\\\\\\\" scoping 到 FT+beam k=4 配置 [critical]\\\\n- [ ] SF1: Beam search §5 正文讨论\\\\n- [ ] SF2: -ing 短语清理 7-8 处\\\\n- [ ] SF3: DocRED effective coverage 显式报告\\\\n- [ ] M2: Contribution #3 拆分\\\\n- [ ] M3: §4 n=4 caveat\\\\n