Round 6 审稿修复计划 — MF1 zero-violations scoping | w10_qwen_scierc_ft_beam_4 |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-18 | D053: 70B 实际使用 Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct-AWQ-INT4（非原计 | P029 |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-18 | D052: BPE collision 论文叙事采用 (C) 方案 — Mistral 碰撞修复作为 | ee_mistral_wikievents_constrained_v3, ee_qwen_wikievents_constrained_v3, ee_llama_wikievents_constrained_v3 |\\\\n| D051 | 2026-05-18 | D050-errata: 更正 D050 中 Mistral v3 数据 — AC=1.3% (非  | ee_mistral_wikievents_constrained_v3 |\\\\n| D050 | 2026-05-18 | D050: v3 全量结果确认 — 三模型 RoV=0%, Mistral AC 16.6%→0%  | ee_qwen_wikievents_constrained_v3, ee_llama_wikievents_constrained_v3, ee_mistral_wikievents_constrained_v3 |\\\\n| D049 | 2026-05-18 | D049: 批准 conference main 补强计划 — P1(70B 实验) + P2(EE | — |\\\\n| D048 | 2026-05-18 | D048: Collision fix 论文呈现采用 (A)+(B) 混合 — 主表只报 v3 最终 | ee_mistral_wikievents_constrained_v2, ee_qwen_wikievents_constrained |\\\\n| D047 | 2026-05-18 | D047: 批准碰撞组 continuation mask 方案修复 Mistral entity_ | ee_mistral_wikievents_constrained_v2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4260, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XVNL3RjvdkD2Vauy1KiMv2","session_id":"868768b3-db3e-406d-8db5-3414a391d999","uuid":"042019a1-dd60-4edf-a7f0-2a17f816a126","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:32:47.295Z"}
